{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1416658-random-character-questions","id":1416658,"title":"Random Character Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-03T18:03:52-07:00","id":1416658,"title":"Random Character Questions","content":"Credit to Sukoshi kaze @twitter<ol class=\"decimal\"><li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Do any of your characters have any problems with their siblings?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Who taught your character how to fight? Do they have a teacher? A mentor? Someone who offered a guiding hand? Or are they self taught?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Are any of your characters parents?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Is your character tough enough to handle a bear?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Can your character send their enemies flying?</span></span></span></li> <li>Do you have a Tokusatsu themed character?</li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Don't lie, is one of your characters a &quot;Chosen One&quot;?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Do you have any characters that practice a specific form of martial arts? If ya do, what kind do they utilize? </span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Do any of your characters own/pilot a giant mech?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Are any of your characters able to drive? (legally) If so, how would you describe their skill behind the wheel? If they cannot drive, how do your OCs get around?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Can your character walk off a sword wound?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Someone offers to take 2 of your characters and put them in a fighting game. Who will you choose? (Also, 2D or 3D style?)</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Would any of your characters perform a German Suplex?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">If they're old enough, how well can your characters handle their drinks? Do any of your characters have any fun stories from their party nights?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">How hard can your character punch?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Do any of your characters have a dark/evil/anti/nega version of themselves?</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171A\"><span style=\"font-family:system-ui\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Do any of your characters know how to cook? If so, what's their specialty? Are any of your characters bad at cooking?</span></span></span></li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T01:58:39-07:00","id":1416700,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">But... but...</span></span> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Screw it. He's MY character, I made him Dragons damn it!<br /> <br /> Cynis Ganan, cont.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FMA245</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1416658-random-character-questions#post1416658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Credit to Sukoshi kaze @twitter</div> </div> </div> </div></span></span><br /> <ol class=\"decimal\"><li><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#14171a\">Do any of your characters have any problems with their siblings?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&quot;Blessedly, I only have one sibling. My father is the oldest of nine, my mother the middle child of seven. I can't even imagine what a living hell that must be.<br /> <br /> &quot;My sister wasn't conceived until after the accident that left me broken, though I was able to walk with the use of a cane. We lived just outside of Greyfalls, and though my mother spared no expense, my sister's tutors were not of the calibur to instruct a student of such rare brilliance and pig-headed insolence.<br /> <br /> &quot;As mother was preoccupied with social engagement (the better to avoid me in the manse), and my sister's tutors were (as aforementioned, incompetent), much of her early instruction fell to me by default. As she grew, and begun to eclipse me in the areas where I have always been... deficient, our relationship soured. When she Exalted at the age of 10 (younger even than myself and mother), she decided she no longer needed instruction from a failed, sorcerous cripple.<br /> <br /> &quot;I bear my sister no ill-will, but we have talked little these past thirty years. We belong to different worlds: though she is a magistrate now, hers is the world of the Dynasty. Of House Cynis galas, of gossip and back biting. Mine is the world of sorcery: of raising edifices that will last a thousand years and breaking the will of our ancient enemies to press them into service. Her goals are flighty and ephemeral, and her concerns vacuous and shallow. She represents everything wrong with the Dynasty (and with House Cynis) and the month we recently spent together was a stark reminder of how much I despise my mother's family.<br /> <br /> &quot;... I miss her. I hope she is safe, and that we will be reunited after this war.&quot;</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#14171a\">Who taught your character how to fight? Do they have a teacher? A mentor? Someone who offered a guiding hand? Or are they self taught?</span><br /> <br /> &quot;My grandmother's estate in Pangu overlooks \u2013 literally overlooks \u2013 an Immaculate monastery. From the moment I could haul my chin over the sill, my instruction in the martial arts began.<br /> <br /> &quot;Formal instruction began at age seven. Ostensibly by from a peacocking Patrician of some very prestigious house (the name of which time as blessedly erased from my memory). I believe I beat him bloody before my eighth birthday, at which point mother took over my tutelage - this was the only subject which she deigned to involve herself in personally, but even this level of involvement was seen as scandalous by grandmother.<br /> <br /> &quot;Saturnday martial arts training with mother was a grueling affair. I was a child, she was a woman fully grown - Exalted and an Immaculate Master. But I managed to master the mortal practice of Earth Dragon Style before my Exaltation (at the same age my mother was Blessed by the Dragons).<br /> <br /> &quot;True mastery of the Immaculate Arts was won at the Heptagram, where I studied not from the Monks of the Immaculate Order but from records of the Lost Age. Shogunate texts, memory crystals, summoned beings from beyond our world. If there was a guiding hand behind that study, and I am not naive enough to assume there couldn't be such influence, it was not known to me.&quot;</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#14171a\">Are any of your characters parents?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Didn\u2019t I just answer that one? Yes. My wife and I have two children.\u201d</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#14171a\">Is your character tough enough to handle a bear?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">I assume you mean \u2018Am I tough enough to wrestle a bear into submission with my bare-hands, without harming the creature or myself, with one hand tied behind my back?\u2019 Because otherwise, the question is just insulting.\u201d</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#14171a\">Can your character send their enemies flying?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\">\u201c</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#14171a\">Yes.\u201d</span></span></span></li> </ol><br /> <br /> <ol class=\"decimal\"><li><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Do you have a Tokusatsu themed character?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Sure. It\u2019s Exalted.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Don't lie, is one of your characters a &amp;quot;Chosen One&amp;quot;?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Only insofar-as they\u2019re Exalted. </span></span></span></li> </ol><br /> <br /> <ol class=\"decimal\"><li><span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Do you have any characters that practice a specific form of martial arts? If ya do, what kind do they utilize? </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">I am a master of the exquisite art of the Earth Dragon Style of Immaculate Martial Arts.\u201d</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Do any of your characters own/pilot a giant mech?</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Not. Yet.\u201d</span></span></span></li> </ol><br /> <br /> <ol class=\"decimal\"><li><span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Are any of your characters able to drive? (legally) If so, how would you describe their skill behind the wheel? If they cannot drive, how do your OCs get around?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">My wife is skilled in sorcery. We generally travel by the sorcerous winds she summons, else we ride on her sister-in-law\u2019s giant Shieldback Lizard. Riding is one of the Dynastic skills I never mastered to my mother\u2019s satisfaction: I don\u2019t get on with horses, but my agata has yet to kick me from the saddle.\u201d</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Can your character walk off a sword wound?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">How in Pasiap\u2019s name was I wounded by a sword? I \u2018walked off\u2019 having my back broken by an exploding manse.\u201d</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Someone offers to take 2 of your characters and put them in a fighting game. Who will you choose? (Also, 2D or 3D style?)</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">That reminds me, I really have to post in Jen\u2019s fighting game thread.</span></span></span></li> </ol><br /> <br /> <ol class=\"decimal\"><li><span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Would any of your characters perform a German Suplex?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">We\u2019ll see.</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">If they're old enough, how well can your characters handle their drinks? Do any of your characters have any fun stories from their party nights?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Drink slows the reactions and dulls the senses. Gluttony interferes with the proper practice of the Immaculate styles. That said, if you\u2019re going to drink then surely the point is to <i>not </i>handle your drink? I believe Reya still tells the story of Ferad and Melody\u2019s wedding celebrations: apparently I danced.\u201d</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">How hard can your character punch?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">I can punch through a brick wall. Is that hard enough for you?\u201d</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Do any of your characters have a dark/evil/anti/nega version of themselves?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1382327-challenge-remaking-your-characters\">Not in canon.</a></span></span></span></li> </ol><br /> <br /> <ol class=\"decimal\"><li><span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Do any of your characters know how to cook? If so, what's their specialty? Are any of your characters bad at cooking?</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#14171a\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Already answered that one too.</span></span></span></li> </ol><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 10-04-2020, 05:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}